{% comment %}
 uc-section-vars.liquid
 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
 Reusable responsive typography, spacing, and container CSS variables.

 PARAMETERS:
 section {Object} Required - the section object
 scope {String} Required - CSS selector e.g. '#ProductTestimonials-{{ section.id }}'

 SCHEMA: Copy settings from docs/section-typography-spacing-schema-template.json
 USAGE:
 {% comment %}
 Correct usage (filters must be assigned first):
 {% assign scope = '#MySection-' | append: section.id %}
 {% render 'uc-section-vars', section: section, scope: scope %}
 {% endcomment %}
 {% render 'uc-section-colors', section: section %}

 Markup classes: uc-sec, uc-sec__container, uc-sec__heading, uc-sec__desc (see uc-section-responsive.css)
 ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
